    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74531" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπλή</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπλον</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hoof,</i> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> always <i>the solid hoof</i> of the horse, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.536
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				20.501
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
